# Definition of Done

Do not claim a feature is Done or `RELEASED` unless
`docs/sdlc/definition-of-done.md` is satisfied.

Merged to `main` without production smoke PASSED is `ON_MAIN`, never
`RELEASED`. Say: **ON_MAIN — not RELEASED.**

Tests listed as passed must have been executed with verifiable evidence.
Use only DESIGNED / NOT EXECUTED / EXECUTED / PASSED / FAILED / SKIPPED /
NOT APPLICABLE / VERIFIED. Close-out checks use PASS / FAIL / MISSING /
NOT APPLICABLE. SKIPPED, NOT APPLICABLE, MISSING, and HEALING are
never PASSED.

Docs-only changes use a reduced DoD (format, review, PR to `test`) with
documented Low risk.
